{!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations on your new career opportunity and although we are sad to see you leave the ATG family, we wish you all the best in your new endeavors.

With your announced resignation, following are the terms of separation with ATG:

1.) Your last day on payroll with ATG is {!Contact.Term_Date__c} 

2.) Your final compensation will include any earned accrued PTO through {!Contact.Term_Date__c}

3.)  Your final ATG payroll including the above compensation will be paid on the next ATG payroll cycle.

4.)  Your ATG provided medical/dental insurance coverage (if applicable) will end the last day of the month of your last day on payroll.

5.)  You will receive a COBRA packet (if applicable) following your separation date.

{!Contact.FirstName} you will be responsible for returning to ATG all of ATG’s property, including without limitation, ATG’s laptop computer, all equipment, files, lists, records, and any other data or property, whether of physical or intellectual nature, of which you are in your possession or control or to which you have access without retaining copies or duplicates thereof, as further set forth in ATG’s Employee Handbook.

Please note that the Employment Agreement prohibits the solicitation, and the attempt to solicit, any of ATG’s clients or prospective clients and the acceptance of work from or performance of services for ATG’s clients or prospective clients for a period of twelve (12) months following separation.  For more information, please see Paragraph 6 of the Employment Agreement, entitled “Competition Prohibited.”

In addition, please note that the Employment Agreement prohibits the communication of ATG’s Confidential Information (as defined therein) during the remaining period of your employment and after your termination, except as explicitly permitted therein.  For more information, please see Paragraph 5 of the Employment Agreement, entitled “Confidential Information.”

{!Contact.FirstName} thank you for your past contribution to ATG during your time with us.  Again, we wish you much success in your new role.

If you have any questions regarding this information please contact me at your convenience.

Regards,

David Mills
Vice President Human Resources
Advanced Technology Group, Inc (ATG)